Last updated 12/7/23

This folder is the work of Rafi and Vincent
The base of the web scraper code was set up by the previous group and modified for our own use.
Much of it now is our own fixes to the code, resolving many bugs and issues it origionally had.

-Main.py: This is the web scraper, Many of the instructions are included at the top of the code.
        -pip install beautifulsoup4
        -pip install requests

-Articles: This folder is where the articles.json file will be stored once the web scraper is ran. Before the web scraper can be ran the Articles.json must be deleted/emptied.